{"id":68,"name":"Al-Qalam","nameAr":"القلم","nameFr":"La plume","place":"makkah","verses":[{"n":1,"k":"68:1","fr":"Noun . Par la plume et ce qu’ils écrivent !","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/068001.mp3","w":[{"t":"نٓ ۚ","en":"Nun","tr":"noon","l":"نٓ ۚ","r":null,"p":"préposition","a":"wbw/068_001_001.mp3"},{"t":"وَٱلْقَلَمِ","en":"By the pen","tr":"wal-qalami","l":"قَلَم","r":"قلم","p":"nom","a":"wbw/068_001_003.mp3"},{"t":"وَمَا","en":"and what","tr":"wamā","l":"ما","r":null,"p":"relatif","a":"wbw/068_001_004.mp3"},{"t":"يَسْطُرُونَ","en":"they write","tr":"yasṭurūna","l":"يَسْطُرُ","r":"سطر","p":"verbe","a":"wbw/068_001_005.mp3"}]},{"n":2,"k":"68:2","fr":"Tu (Mohammed) n’est pas, par la grâce de ton Seigneur, un possédé.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/068002.mp3","w":[{"t":"مَآ","en":"Not","tr":"mā","l":"ما","r":null,"p":"négation","a":"wbw/068_002_001.mp3"},{"t":"أَنتَ","en":"you (are)","tr":"anta","l":"أَنتَ","r":null,"p":"pronom","a":"wbw/068_002_002.mp3"},{"t":"بِنِعْمَةِ","en":"by (the) Grace","tr":"biniʿ'mati","l":"نِعْمَة","r":"نعم","p":"nom","a":"wbw/068_002_003.mp3"},{"t":"رَبِّكَ","en":"(of) your Lord","tr":"rabbika","l":"رَبّ","r":"ربب","p":"nom","a":"wbw/068_002_004.mp3"},{"t":"بِمَجْنُونٍۢ","en":"a madman","tr":"bimajnūnin","l":"مَجْنُون","r":"جنن","p":"nom","a":"wbw/068_002_005.mp3"}]},{"n":3,"k":"68:3","fr":"Et il y aura pour toi certes, une récompense jamais interrompue.","audio":"Alafasy/mp3/068003.mp3","w":[{"t":"وَإِنَّ","en":"And indeed","tr":"wa-inna","l":"إِنّ","r":null,"p":"particule","a":"wbw/068_003_001.mp3"},{"t":"لَكَ","en":"for you","tr":"laka","l":"لَكَ","r":null,"p":"pronom","a":"wbw/068_003_002.mp3"},{"t":"لَأَجْرًا","en":"surely (is) a reward","tr":"la-ajran","l":"أَجْر","r":"أجر","p":"particule","a":"wbw/068_003_003.mp3"},{"t":"غَيْرَ","en":"without","tr":"ghayra","l":"غَيْر","r":"غير","p":"particule","a":"wbw/068_003_004.mp3"},{"t":"مَمْنُونٍۢ","en":"end","tr":"mamnūnin","l":"مَمْنُون","r":"منن","p":"nom","a":"wbw/068_003_005.mp3"}]},{"n":4,"k":"68